  type: article
  title: "TLabel: Unified Tactile Data Annotation and Interchange for Robotic Manipulation"
  authors:
    - name: "Wu, Sheng"
    - name: "Luo, Xi"
  year: 2026
  journal: "Under review"
abstract: >
  TLabel is an open-source toolkit and format standard for tactile sensor data annotation.
  It provides a 14-dimension semantic schema with Compliance Levels (L1-L4), sensor-agnostic
  data loading, interactive annotation, AI pre-annotation, and multi-format export
  (JSON, CSV, FTP-1 Zarr, LeRobot, RLDS, ROS2) across 9 tactile sensor adapters.
keywords:
  - tactile sensing
  - data annotation
  - robot manipulation
  - embodied AI
  - data format standard
